2032
01:08:39,120 --> 01:08:40,800
Liang Xiaoyu chose Chen Hewen.

2033
01:08:40,800 --> 01:08:41,319
Okay.

2034
01:08:41,319 --> 01:08:42,080
(Che Hewen to Liang Xiaoyu)
They chose each other.

2035
01:08:42,080 --> 01:08:44,000
