Another new day. How does it feel?

2039
01:08:56,640 --> 01:08:57,640
Pretty good.

2040
01:09:04,960 --> 01:09:07,200
(Cui Kaiyi to Cao Yiheng)
I felt really safe

2041
01:09:07,200 --> 01:09:09,359
