2042
01:09:09,359 --> 01:09:10,760
Get some rest early.

2043
01:09:10,760 --> 01:09:11,640
Nice.

2044
01:09:16,840 --> 01:09:18,160
(Wu Siying to Cui Yihang)
I had a great time today.

2045
01:09:18,160 --> 01:09:19,160
A tilde.

2046
01:09:19,160 --> 01:09:20,080
So her (Wu Siying).

2047
01:09:20,080 --> 01:09:21,880
Everyone has their own social style.

2048
01:09:31,479 --> 01:09:33,319
(Liang Xiaoyu to Chen Hewen)
Thanks for taking care of me.

2049
01:09:33,319 --> 01:09:34,399
I had a great time today.

2050
01:09:34,399 --> 01:09:35,720
I really enjoyed

2051
01:09:35,720 --> 01:09:37,399
