2052
01:09:37,399 --> 01:09:39,640
Come find me whenever you wanna chat.

2053
01:09:40,680 --> 01:09:41,800
She put the invitation out there.

2054
01:09:41,800 --> 01:09:43,200
Being seen and appreciated,

2055
01:09:43,200 --> 01:09:44,520
and actively chosen.

2056
01:09:48,000 --> 01:09:49,240
Zhao Xilun.

2057
01:09:49,640 --> 01:09:51,240
(Sun Qimeng to Zhao Xilun)
You're the one in the house

2058
01:09:51,240 --> 01:09:53,800
who feels special to me.

2059
01:09:53,800 --> 01:09:55,960
You're so quirky and fun.

2060
01:09:55,960 --> 01:09:56,600
That's nice.

2061
01:10:04,440 --> 01:10:07,760
(Sha Yue'er to Zhao Xilun)
We both tend to overthink.

2062
01:10:07,760 --> 01:10:10,240
Thanks for encouraging me
in the car today.

2063
01:10:15,120 --> 01:10:16,640
No one texted Sun Bohan.

2064
01:10:16,640 --> 01:10:16,920
Right.

2065
01:10:16,920 --> 01:10:18,120
Sun Bohan didn't get one.

2066
01:10:33,520 --> 01:10:34,520
(Yu Yang to Liang Renfang)
Slowly...

2067
01:10:35,560 --> 01:10:36,650
(What does that mean?)
An underscore?

2068
01:10:36,680 --> 01:10:40,160
♪Slowly falling for you♪

2069
01:10:40,160 --> 01:10:41,680
Still needs filling in.

2070
01:10:41,960 --> 01:10:43,240
Fill in the blank yourself.

2071
01:10:43,240 --> 01:10:44,200
My love for you.

2072
01:10:44,260 --> 01:10:45,200
(I get it now)

2073
01:10:45,200 --> 01:10:46,160
Classy.

2074
01:10:50,240 --> 01:10:51,800
(Cao Yiheng to Cui Kaiyi)
When I'm with you,

2075
01:10:51,800 --> 01:10:53,440
