2076
01:10:53,440 --> 01:10:56,080
Drink plenty of warm water.
Take care of your voice.

2077
01:10:57,340 --> 01:10:58,180
(Smiles)

2078
01:10:58,200 --> 01:10:58,880
She couldn't hold it in.

2079
01:10:58,880 --> 01:11:00,640
When someone you like
tells you to drink warm water,

2080
01:11:00,640 --> 01:11:02,560
