2081
01:11:05,120 --> 01:11:06,280
(Cui Yihang to Wu Siying)
Take your time and relax.

2082
01:11:06,280 --> 01:11:07,720
They both write so little.

2083
01:11:07,720 --> 01:11:08,800
Very practical.

2084
01:11:08,800 --> 01:11:10,240
That's so their style.

2085
01:11:10,240 --> 01:11:11,920
They really did choose each other.

2086
01:11:18,640 --> 01:11:19,720
(Sun Bohan to Sha Yue'er)
This one's from Sun Bohan to Sha Yue'er.

2087
01:11:19,720 --> 01:11:22,000
I had so much fun
singing with you today.

2088
01:11:22,000 --> 01:11:24,920
I'm glad I got to see the real you.

2089
01:11:25,760 --> 01:11:26,760
So now,

2090
01:11:26,760 --> 01:11:27,840
Sha Yue'er has to figure out

2091
01:11:27,840 --> 01:11:29,960
who sent her this message.

2092
01:11:29,960 --> 01:11:31,000
Definitely Sun Bohan.

2093
01:11:31,000 --> 01:11:31,920
They sang together.

2094
01:11:35,040 --> 01:11:35,960
There's another one.

2095
01:11:36,520 --> 01:11:37,640
(Zhao Xilun to Sha Yue'er)
You really sing beautifully.

2096
01:11:37,640 --> 01:11:38,880
Get some rest.

2097
01:11:38,880 --> 01:11:40,400
You can't tell who sent this one.

2098
01:11:40,400 --> 01:11:41,160
Right.

2099
01:11:50,000 --> 01:11:50,880
Liang Xiaoyu.

2100
01:11:50,880 --> 01:11:51,800
(Chen Hewen to Liang Xiaoyu)
Welcome to the house.

2101
01:11:51,800 --> 01:11:53,760
I hope I can get to know you better.

2102
01:11:53,760 --> 01:11:55,280
Sleep well tonight.

2103
01:11:59,680 --> 01:12:00,840
Sun Qimeng didn't get a text.

2104
01:12:00,840 --> 01:12:01,240
Right.

2105
01:12:01,240 --> 01:12:02,800
Only Sun Qimeng and Sun Bohan didn't.

2106
01:12:08,320 --> 01:12:09,200
Now it's pretty clear.

2107
01:12:09,200 --> 01:12:10,640
Sha Yue'er really didn't get

2108
01:12:10,640 --> 01:12:11,640
a text from Chen Hewen.

2109
01:12:11,640 --> 01:12:12,800
She's even more upset now.

2110
01:12:12,800 --> 01:12:14,320
Things change every day.

2111
01:12:14,680 --> 01:12:15,280
Honestly,

2112
01:12:15,280 --> 01:12:16,520
when someone pursues you

2113
01:12:16,520 --> 01:12:17,360
or likes you,

2114
01:12:17,360 --> 01:12:18,560
