2115
01:12:18,560 --> 01:12:19,600
I can like you,

2116
01:12:19,600 --> 01:12:20,640
or I can like someone else.

2117
01:12:20,640 --> 01:12:21,200
I'm free to choose.

2118
01:12:21,200 --> 01:12:21,800
But the person

2119
01:12:21,800 --> 01:12:22,520
on the receiving end

2120
01:12:22,520 --> 01:12:23,320
is in a much more

2121
01:12:23,320 --> 01:12:23,840
passive position.

2122
01:12:23,900 --> 01:12:25,140
(Makes sense)
Right.

2123
01:12:27,340 --> 01:12:28,500
(Mini tantrum)

2124
01:12:31,580 --> 01:12:33,220
(Reenacts it)

2125
01:12:33,280 --> 01:12:34,200
Princess.

2126
01:12:34,200 --> 01:12:35,240
I don't know why,

2127
01:12:35,240 --> 01:12:36,960
but I love watching Sha Yue'er do this.

2128
01:12:37,400 --> 01:12:38,720
Yeah, she's adorable.

2129
01:12:42,840 --> 01:12:44,760
Using him as a stand-in.

2130
01:12:44,760 --> 01:12:46,040
To vent her anger.

2131
01:12:46,040 --> 01:12:47,120
She's so mad she's laughing.

2132
01:12:47,120 --> 01:12:48,840
I don't think he texted me.

2133
01:12:48,840 --> 01:12:49,560
Hands on her hips.

2134
01:12:49,560 --> 01:12:50,720
Why?

2135
01:12:53,080 --> 01:12:54,680
Why did he suddenly switch?

2136
01:12:56,260 --> 01:12:57,460
(Hmph)

2137
01:12:57,480 --> 01:12:58,600
Don't be mad.

2138
01:12:58,600 --> 01:12:59,600
Sit.

2139
01:12:59,600 --> 01:13:00,240
Don't be mad.

2140
01:13:02,200 --> 01:13:03,320
I'm just a little mad.

2141
01:13:03,840 --> 01:13:04,720
That's normal.

2142
01:13:08,080 --> 01:13:09,160
But these past few days,

2143
01:13:09,160 --> 01:13:11,320
I thought he was pretty proactive.

2144
01:13:11,320 --> 01:13:12,360
She says she's mad,

2145
01:13:12,360 --> 01:13:13,560
but she's probably disappointed too.

2146
01:13:13,760 --> 01:13:14,600
She's

2147
01:13:14,600 --> 01:13:15,560
also confused.

2148
01:13:15,560 --> 01:13:16,480
Right.

2149
01:13:17,160 --> 01:13:18,880
Why did he suddenly...

2150
01:13:18,880 --> 01:13:19,360
I don't get it.

2151
01:13:19,360 --> 01:13:20,440
Because today,

2152
01:13:20,440 --> 01:13:21,560
I wasn't really watching you guys.

2153
01:13:21,560 --> 01:13:21,880
You know?

2154
01:13:21,880 --> 01:13:22,680
I was busy

2155
01:13:22,680 --> 01:13:24,240
talking to Cao Yiheng all day.

2156
01:13:25,840 --> 01:13:27,840
We get it!

2157
01:13:27,840 --> 01:13:29,320
So cute!

2158
01:13:30,680 --> 01:13:32,160
I was busy

2159
01:13:32,160 --> 01:13:33,400
talking to Cao Yiheng all day.

2160
01:13:33,640 --> 01:13:33,920
And...

2161
01:13:33,920 --> 01:13:34,800
I saw you two,

2162
01:13:34,800 --> 01:13:36,760
so I didn't wanna interrupt.

2163
01:13:38,040 --> 01:13:39,240
So I didn't pay attention.

2164
01:13:39,240 --> 01:13:40,640
I should've watched more closely.

2165
01:13:40,640 --> 01:13:42,400
One person's joy is another's misery.

2166
01:13:42,400 --> 01:13:44,520
I didn't notice
what was happening over there.

2167
01:13:48,320 --> 01:13:49,280
It's okay.

2168
01:13:53,720 --> 01:13:55,200
Men

2169
01:13:55,200 --> 01:13:56,520
are like clothes.

2170
01:13:58,720 --> 01:13:59,800
Cui Kaiyi is hilarious!

2171
01:14:00,160 --> 01:14:01,160
So funny.

2172
01:14:01,480 --> 01:14:02,480
Men

2173
01:14:02,480 --> 01:14:03,480
are like clothes.

2174
01:14:03,580 --> 01:14:04,740
(Still not done)

2175
01:14:05,320 --> 01:14:06,800
Men

2176
01:14:06,800 --> 01:14:08,480
are like clothes.

2177
01:14:10,720 --> 01:14:13,040
Maybe he's just spending
more time with Liang Xiaoyu

2178
01:14:13,470 --> 01:14:14,680
right now.

2179
01:14:14,680 --> 01:14:16,380
I don't get it, but I respect it.

2180
01:14:18,320 --> 01:14:19,000
I think

2181
01:14:19,000 --> 01:14:19,560
sometimes

2182
01:14:19,560 --> 01:14:21,000
between besties, it's like,

2183
01:14:21,000 --> 01:14:21,880
I know you too well.

2184
01:14:21,880 --> 01:14:22,960
You already have

2185
01:14:22,960 --> 01:14:23,800
your own way of...

2186
01:14:23,800 --> 01:14:24,460
Processing things.

2187
01:14:24,460 --> 01:14:25,280
Your own way of processing it.

2188
01:14:25,280 --> 01:14:27,200
I don't really need to give you advice.

2189
01:14:27,200 --> 01:14:28,760
I can just tease you a little

2190
01:14:28,760 --> 01:14:30,560
to help you relax.

2191
01:14:30,840 --> 01:14:31,960
Right.

2192
01:14:32,320 --> 01:14:34,680
Everyone this season is so open.

2193
01:14:34,680 --> 01:14:35,840
Yeah.

2194
01:14:35,840 --> 01:14:36,640
Very direct.

2195
01:14:36,640 --> 01:14:38,120
We've leveled up.

2196
01:14:38,920 --> 01:14:40,480
This year, we're keeping it real.

2197
01:14:40,950 --> 01:14:42,240
I like it.

2198
01:14:42,240 --> 01:14:44,200
But on the other hand,

2199
01:14:44,200 --> 01:14:46,160
(Liang Xiaoyu, proactive newcomer)
one girl is really proactive with me

2200
01:14:46,160 --> 01:14:47,480
and she's new.

2201
01:14:47,480 --> 01:14:48,480
Then the other one

2202
01:14:48,480 --> 01:14:49,640
has a lot of guys after her.

2203
01:14:49,640 --> 01:14:50,960
(Sha Yue'er, everyone adores her)
Everyone's pursuing her.

2204
01:14:50,960 --> 01:14:52,240
So if

2205
01:14:52,240 --> 01:14:53,600
someone reaches out to me,

2206
01:14:53,600 --> 01:14:54,680
why wouldn't

2207
01:14:54,680 --> 01:14:55,680
I respond?

2208
01:14:55,680 --> 01:14:57,080
(Agrees)
Exactly.

2209
01:14:57,080 --> 01:14:58,640
At this stage,

2210
01:14:58,640 --> 01:14:59,920
(Early stage)
there's still room

2211
01:14:59,920 --> 01:15:01,320
for everyone to get to know each other.

2212
01:15:01,320 --> 01:15:01,720
Right.

2213
01:15:03,420 --> 01:15:07,460
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
